整个脚本一百来行 bash，干干净净：核心就是调 displayplacer 切分辨率，加 defaults write 控制热区，再做了个幂等检测防止重复切换时屏幕闪烁。没有依赖注入，没有后台常驻，跑完就退出，干净利落。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"脚本已经开源到 GitHub，MIT 协议，随便用随便改。整个脚本一百来行 bash，干干净净：核心就是调 displayplacer 切分辨率，加 defaults write 控制热区，再做了个幂等检测防止重复切换时屏幕闪烁。没有依赖注入，没有后台常驻，跑完就退出，干净利落。","href":null}],"icon":null,"color":"default"},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"39599968-1bdb-8138-9db0-c0a7fdbe9cee","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"39599968-1bdb-81af-9d79-c5f08653b173"},"created_time":"2026-07-06T12:09:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2026-07-06T12:09:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"paragraph","paragraph":{"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"如果你用的不是 16 寸 MacBook Pro，避刘海的分辨率数字可能不一样。脚本顶部留了配置项，改两个数字就行，不知道支持哪些分辨率就敲一条 displayplacer list，所有可选模式都会列出来：","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"如果你用的不是 16 寸 MacBook Pro，避刘海的分辨率数字可能不一样。脚本顶部留了配置项，改两个数字就行，不知道支持哪些分辨率就敲一条 displayplacer list，所有可选模式都会列出来：","href":null}],"icon":null,"color":"default"},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"39599968-1bdb-813c-a0d9-c2a6ad276603","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"39599968-1bdb-81af-9d79-c5f08653b173"},"created_time":"2026-07-06T12:09:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2026-07-06T12:15:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"87280683-c5bb-4550-8935-f21a199c54e0"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"callout","callout":{"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"自定义分辨率: \nGAME_RES=\"1512x945\"      # 你的避刘海分辨率\nDEFAULT_RES=\"1512x982\"   # 你的默认分辨率","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"it